{{#> layout
  title='The fastest way to learn a language'
  metaDescription=''
  url='/ai.html'
  ogDescription=''
  navbarAlwaysMurky=true
  navbarSpacing="mb-0"
  navbarContainerClass="container-md"
  noCta=true
  nonStickyNavbar=true
  disabledAutoTrack=true
}}
  <div class="container-md">
    <div class="pt-3 pb-5">
      <h1 class="h3">The fasted way to learn a language.</h1>

      <p>Do you know why children pick up languages almost immediately and adults struggle? Because:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Children use language to ask questions and complain about problems</li>
        <li>Adults mostly use language to answer questions and solve someone else's problems</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="background: #f9f9f9;">
    <div class="container-md py-5" style="font-size: 80%">
      <h2 class="h5" style="color: var(--bs-body-color); font-size: 140%">An AI prompt</h2>

      <div class="mb-4">
        <p>What language are you learning?</p>

        <select id="language" name='language' aria-label='Language' class="form-select form-select-sm mb-4">
          {{#each htmlWebpackPlugin.options.environment.languages}}
            <option value='{{this.code}}'>{{this.label}}</option>
          {{/each}}
        </select>

        <p>Awesome! Now copy this prompt:</p>

        <style>
          #prompt-wrapper {
            --padding: 2rem;

            font-size: 90%;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            position: relative;
            padding: var(--padding);

            #copy-button {
              position: absolute;
              bottom: var(--padding);
              right: var(--padding);
              display: flex;
              align-items: center;
              gap: 0.5rem;
              border-radius: 0.5rem;
              letter-spacing: -0.02em;
              font-size: 90%;
            }
          }
        </style>

        <pre class="bg-dark text-light" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;" id="prompt-wrapper"><code id="prompt"></code><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" id="copy-button"><i class="bi bi-copy"></i><span>Copy</span></button></pre>

        <p>You are amazing! Now add this prompt to the context of AI you are using:</p>

        <style>
          #ai-tabs {
            --ai-radius: 0.75rem;

            .ai-tabs-nav {
              display: flex;
              gap: 0.25rem;
              padding: 0.25rem;
              margin-bottom: 1rem;
              background: #ececec;
              border-radius: var(--ai-radius);
            }

            .ai-tab {
              flex: 1 1 0;
              display: inline-flex;
              align-items: center;
              justify-content: center;
              gap: 0.4rem;
              padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
              border: 0;
              background: transparent;
              color: var(--bs-secondary-color);
              border-radius: calc(var(--ai-radius) - 0.25rem);
              font-weight: 500;
              cursor: pointer;
              transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
            }

            .ai-tab:hover {
              color: var(--bs-body-color);
            }

            .ai-tab[aria-selected='true'] {
              background: #fff;
              color: var(--bs-body-color);
              box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
            }

            .ai-tab .bi {
              font-size: 1.15em;
              line-height: 1;
            }

            .ai-panel {
              padding: 1.25rem;
              background: #fff;
              border-radius: var(--ai-radius);
            }

            .ai-panel[hidden] {
              display: none;
            }

            .ai-steps {
              margin: 0;
              padding-left: 1.2rem;
            }

            .ai-steps > li + li {
              margin-top: 0.6rem;
            }

            .bi-box-arrow-up-right {
              font-size: 0.85em;
              margin-left: 0.35em;
            }
          }
        </style>

        <div id="ai-tabs">
          <div class="ai-tabs-nav" role="tablist" aria-label="AI assistant">
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              class="ai-tab"
              id="ai-tab-chatgpt"
              data-ai-tab="chatgpt"
              aria-controls="ai-panel-chatgpt"
              aria-selected="true"
            ><i class="bi bi-chat-dots"></i>ChatGPT</button>
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              class="ai-tab"
              id="ai-tab-gemini"
              data-ai-tab="gemini"
              aria-controls="ai-panel-gemini"
              aria-selected="false"
              tabindex="-1"
            ><i class="bi bi-stars"></i>Gemini</button>
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              class="ai-tab"
              id="ai-tab-claude"
              data-ai-tab="claude"
              aria-controls="ai-panel-claude"
              aria-selected="false"
              tabindex="-1"
            ><i class="bi bi-asterisk"></i>Claude</button>
          </div>

          <div
            class="ai-panel"
            role="tabpanel"
            id="ai-panel-chatgpt"
            data-ai-panel="chatgpt"
            aria-labelledby="ai-tab-chatgpt"
          >
            <ol class="ai-steps">
              <li>
                <a
                  class="btn btn-dark btn-sm"
                  href="https://chatgpt.com/#settings/Personalization"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                >Customize ChatGPT<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
              </li>
              <li>Paste the prompt into <strong>&ldquo;Anything else ChatGPT should know about you?&rdquo;</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Save</strong> &rarr; open a new chat.</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div
            class="ai-panel"
            role="tabpanel"
            id="ai-panel-gemini"
            data-ai-panel="gemini"
            aria-labelledby="ai-tab-gemini"
            hidden
          >
            <ol class="ai-steps">
              <li>
                <a
                  class="btn btn-dark btn-sm"
                  href="https://gemini.google.com/saved-info"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                >Saved info<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
              </li>
              <li><i class="bi bi-plus-lg"></i> <strong>Add info</strong> &rarr; paste the prompt.</li>
              <li><strong>Save</strong> &rarr; open a new chat.</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div
            class="ai-panel"
            role="tabpanel"
            id="ai-panel-claude"
            data-ai-panel="claude"
            aria-labelledby="ai-tab-claude"
            hidden
          >
            <ol class="ai-steps">
              <li>
                <a
                  class="btn btn-dark btn-sm"
                  href="https://claude.ai/settings/profile"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                >Claude settings &rarr; Profile<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
              </li>
              <li>Paste the prompt into <strong>&ldquo;What personal preferences should Claude consider in responses?&rdquo;</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Save</strong> &rarr; open a new chat.</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {{> social-share
      }}
    </div>
  </div>
{{/layout}}

